{"id": "t114-001", "text": "Ibrahim's half marathon is Sunday 12 October, his first one. He's raising money for the hospice that looked after his grandad, nearly at £900 already. His wife and their two boys are coming to cheer at mile 10 with a banner. He's worried about his calf, pulled it a few weeks ago. Remind me to text him good luck on Saturday night.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ibrahim", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "half marathon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday 12 October", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boys", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few weeks ago"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday night", "anchor": "a1"}]}
