{"id": "t114-042", "text": "Cem had his physio appointment yesterday, it's a tear in the meniscus apparently. Might need surgery, which would rule out Berlin. He's properly down about it, he's been training since March and already paid for the hotel. His girlfriend Kerry is trying to keep him positive. Remind me to ring him after his scan next Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Cem", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "physio appointment", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "tear in the meniscus", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surgery", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Berlin", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "down", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since March"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kerry", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e4", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Friday", "anchor": "e4"}]}
