{"id": "t114-050", "text": "Sophie and Dafydd went to Lapland last week with the kids, saw the northern lights on the last night. Sophie said the reindeer sleigh thing was a bit of a rip-off though, and the flight back from Rovaniemi was delayed six hours. Their youngest, Matilda, threw up on the plane. They're already talking about going back to Norway next winter instead.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dafydd", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "went to Lapland", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the last night"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "youngest", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matilda", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going back to Norway", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next winter", "anchor": "e2"}]}
