{"id": "t114-056", "text": "Shreya's wedding was supposed to be in Goa in March but it's been called off, she and her fiancé split up. She's taking it hard, going to stay with her parents in Leicester for a bit. Dont mention it at work. Remind me to message her on Sunday just to see how she's doing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shreya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "fiancé", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "taking it hard", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t114-057", "text": "Kerry's son is in the school production of Oliver! next Tuesday and Wednesday, he's the Artful Dodger. She's been sewing his costume all week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kerry", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "school production of Oliver", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tuesday and Wednesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Artful Dodger", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t114-058", "text": "Laura and her partner off to Mexico tomorrow for two weeks, then a week in Cuba. She's been planning it since last year. Ask her how Havana was when she's back on the 3rd.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laura", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Mexico", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "week in Cuba", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since last year"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask her how Havana was", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "when she's back on the 3rd", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t114-059", "text": "Ibrahim's daughter Hadiza has her violin recital on 22 November, Grade 8. He said she's been practising four hours a day and is a nervous wreck. Wish her luck the night before. He also said he's training for a triathlon in the spring, open water swimming every Saturday morning at the lake.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ibrahim", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hadiza", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "violin recital", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "22 November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Grade 8", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous wreck", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Wish her luck", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "triathlon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "open water swimming", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "every Saturday morning"}]}
{"id": "t114-060", "text": "Gym at 7 tomorrow then food shop. Tuesday sort the boiler service.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Gym", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "7 tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "food shop", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "a3"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort the boiler service", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
